{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "readme",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": -420,
			"width": 1280,
			"height": 330,
			"text": "# World\nThis canvas **is the game**. Each labelled group is a screen.\n\n- The **picture card** in a group is the scene. Drag other cards onto it to place them.\n- An **object note** card (like the intercom) is clickable where it sits.\n- A **text card with an arrow** to another screen is a button that goes there. Label the arrow `if ...` to add a rule.\n- A text card that starts with `if ...` shows only when that is true.\n- Cards outside the screen groups are just notes.\n\nPlay it: `npm run app`. See [[Start here]]."
		},
		{
			"id": "south-gate",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "south-gate",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 1360,
